<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Longhorn Steaks EPS lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Longhorn Steaks EPS lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securties Inc said it lowered its third quarter earnings estimates for Longhorn Steaks Inc to $0.18 a share from $0.21.</p>
<p>-- In a report dated September 20, EVEREN said the cut was made because of eroding operations at recently acquired Bugaboo Creek Steakhouse, estimated to account for a $0.02 a share decline, and bonuses paid to kitchen staff during the Olympics, pegged at $0.01 a share.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
